SUSPECTED BUG: same || narrowing gap as is_or_true_branch, on a continue edge.
Retry loop: nil -> return; Is(ErrTimeout) || Is(ErrRateLimited) -> continue; else fail fast with "job %s: %w";
after the loop "retries exhausted: %w" wraps the last retryable error.
